        "slide": 1,
        "role": "cover",
        "subject": "The near sensor-topped crossover stand-in, seen from its front quarter at eye height. Its row of noses and an instanced lot run back to a dark horizon on striped asphalt.",
        "visual_consequence": "Without the headline, the frame reads as one identical robotaxi model repeated by the hundreds, all the way to the horizon. It shows scale and sameness before any numeral is read, which sets up the 3,164 vehicles and 17 names.",
        "weakness": "The paint reads as matte clay more than weathered metallic. The 6 of c26 sits on the dark rubber of the near front tire, still legible.",
        "repair": "Optional polish. Nudge the near car about 20 design px further up or left so c26 clears the tire, and add a little clearcoat to the paint.",
        "encoding_reads": true,
        "dominant_subject_finished": true,
        "feed_legible": true,
